Used by crates/xr-frontend's menu bar through [patch.crates-io] in the workspace Cargo.toml.

Changes (all of them):
1. src/platform_impl/windows/dark_menu_bar.rs, WM_UAHDRAWMENUITEM: the title buffer is a zeroed Vec of 256 and its
   length is what GetMenuItemInfoW is told, instead of size_of_val of the Vec (24 bytes), which cut every menu bar
   title in dark mode to 10 characters ("Multiplayer" showed as "Multiplaye").
2. Cargo.lock, Cargo.toml.orig and .cargo_vcs_info.json from the crate package are left out.
